window.products.push({"id":1079146,"name":"Nonstick Candy Jelly Molds Chocolate Molds Soap Molds，Food Grade Silicone Baking Molds，Forest Theme Happy Bear Lion Hippo Leaves More Fun Toy Kids Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E23Dm2o4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Whether you are looking for a fun treat for the family or just yourself, these silicone molds for candy are a lifesaver!  Here, our quality matters. That’s why our candy mold is made from our best quality chocolate molds silicone.  Never deal with candies sticking to your silicone chocolate mold again. Our silicon mold has thermal stability.  That is also why adding our silicone candy molds chocolate to your candy making supplies is a must!  Using them as mint molds for cream cheese mints, fat bomb molds, chocolate molds, hard candy molds, jello molds, ice cube molds and sugar fondant molds are only a fraction of ways to use them.  You can use these as silicone molds for baking, or silicone molds for fat bombs during a keto diet too.  Using our chocolate candy molds silicone to make delicious treats is easy!  Follow these easy steps to ensure the best product outcome from the best candy mold silicone:  1.Thoroughly clean silicon molds.  2.Now the fun part! Melt your chocolate.  3.Pour melted chocolate into silicone mold.  4.Make sure chocolate is filled to the rim.  5.Place chocolate in refrigerator till fully cured and cooled. (approximately 20 - 25 minutes)  6.Turn the silicone candy mold upside down and press lightly on the bottom to remove a chocolate.  Enjoy!  Create any kind of ice cubes.  Add berries, fruits or even red pepper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E23Dm2o4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"San people","source_asin":"B07SQ9XDZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQ9XDZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQ9XDZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
