window.products.push({"id":1079267,"name":"Choice of Connoisseurs 12 Reusable Granite Whiskey Ice Cubes Stones with Velvet Pouch and Tongs Gift Box Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XMfDpNNsL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","description":"Choice of Connoisseurs Whiskey Stones will cool your drink perfectly without diluting the flavour or the aroma. Now all your favourite drinks, Whiskey, Scotch, Bourbon, Tequila and the like, can be served the way they were intended, perfectly pure and perfectly chilled. Our Natural Granite Whiskey Stones are non-porous meaning they will not absorb other odours or flavours that may tarnish your drink. They are also gently tumbled to create smooth rounded edges ensuring your best whiskey glasses do not get scratched. Whiskey Stones are intended to provide a slight chill, between 8 and 15 degrees - they are not meant to cool your drink as quickly or as much as ice. So your favourite Whiskey just got better, protect the taste without diluting the character. How To Use: 1. Rinse stones, dry and then place in your freezer for at least 4 hours. 2. When ready, use your tongs and add three stones to your glass. 3. Pour your favourite Whiskey over the stones. Let the drink sit for a few minutes to allow the stones to chill your drink. 4. ENJOY - perfectly chilled, no dilution. 5. When finished, simply rinse and dry the stones, return them to your freezer. Once cold, store your stones in the Velvet Bag. 6. Never chew or attempt to eat. At Choice of Connoisseurs we strive to make sure your experience with our product is everything you deserve. If your product has arrived in an unsatisfactory condition please let us know and we will endeavour to do whatever it takes to make things right for you. We also offer a full money back guarantee under Amazon terms and conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XMfDpNNsL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Choice of Connoisseurs","source_asin":"B01ABOK5RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ABOK5RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ABOK5RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
