window.products.push({"id":1079344,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners, Anti-Leak Mini Air Conditioner Portable AC, 3 Quiet Speeds Evaporative Air Cooler with Remote, Timer, LED Display, Personal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3YPNaaWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️3S FAST COOLING & MISTING WITHOUT WAITING - Compared with traditional air conditioner portable, SPORNIT portable air conditioners adopt advanced water cooling system with dual misting jets to provide you a chilly wave of coolness like a forest breeze and atomize water in seconds, turning roasting temps to pleasant 75℉. Larger air outlet design give off 2X air volume than regular mini air conditioner. With the highest speed up to 4.5M/s, you can enjoy the breeze even at the distance of 10ft! ❄️LARGER 500ML WATER TANK FOR LONG LASTING COOL - With large ice water capacity, this small air conditioner can keep you cool up to 8hrs. The more ice you add, the colder breeze you enjoy! Plus, the 2/4H timer lets you customize your using time to prevent cold or headache from all-night cooling. It's your must-have personal air conditioner for summer. Built-in 4000mAh rechargeable battery, this mini ac unit can be used wirelessly. It can also be plugged in via included USB cable for lasting use. ❄️SPACE-SAVING PORTABLE & SIMPLE CONTROL - The size of 6.6\"*4.5\"*9.8\"means no big space is needed. The compact and handheld design allows you to place this portable ac air conditioner on your car, office, nightstand, coffee table, kitchen counter or camping tent. With a LED display screen, all you need is just plug it up and press it, then you are ready to sit back and enjoy the fresh breeze. Plus, comes with a remote control, everything is under your control while relaxing on the sofa or bed. ❄️ECO-FRIENDLY COOLING DEVICE=LOWER YOUR ENERGY BILL - Unlike traditional air conditioners that use harmful Freon and power-hungry compressors, this air cooling desktop fan run on 10 watts, you can also long press the timer button to turn off all indicators to minimize energy consumption. This air conditioner fan are a great and affordable way to keep you cool while keeping your bank account from sweating out. Invest now! You can save up to 50% on your cooling bills without sacrificing comfort. ❄️NOISELESS & STYLISH OPTION, BE A LOYAL FAN NOW - Comes with a brushless motor, this portable ac unit is less noisy than other normal evaporative cooler with a brushed motor. Seven-color backlight and stylish design serve you the most ideal atmosphere for day and night. May this air conditioner for room accompany your sultry summer. We truly provide a 30-days no-question refund. Any questions about our portable air cooler, please feel free to contact us, you always on our loyal customer lists!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3YPNaaWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPORNIT","source_asin":"B09X34LMCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X34LMCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X34LMCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
