window.products.push({"id":1079410,"name":"Digging Dolls: 3 lbs Bulk Rough Fiesta Mix of Stones from Mexico - Large Raw & Natural Rough Rock Crystals for Tumbling, Crafts, Art, Gem Mining, Cabb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81plvIEQ6qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rockhounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and most spectacular stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.This is our Fiesta Mix from Mexico. This mix will include many of our stones from Mexico including obsidians, calcites, jaspers and many more. Some of the stones may be duplicated in each bag and not every type will be found in every bag as this is a random mix of stones and your order is scooped at random. Our Dolls meet with the mine owners multiple times per year and scrutinize every shipment of stones to ensure they meet the high standards required to be part of the Digging Dolls brand. These stones are easy to use and can be used for many different purposes including wire wrapping, jewelry making, wedding or home decor, crafts, art projects, reiki, fountains and so much more! On average the sizes of these stones are between 1\" and 2\" per piece. Every stone is unique, and you will not be receiving the exact stones in the pictures. As earth mined stones it is possible the stones may include possible minor flaws, imperfections, variance in colors, clarity, shapes, sizes, and patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81plvIEQ6qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B07NZWDH69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NZWDH69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NZWDH69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
