window.products.push({"id":1079417,"name":"Merax 26\" Portable Storage Island Kitchen Trolley Drawers, Microwave Cart, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O2ZAaqEAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your space just the right amount of extra storage you need with the Merax Portable Island Kitchen Cart. Featuring a smoothed oak top on a durable sleek black lacquered frame, this cart can both serve as valuable extra storage or an extension of your kitchen counter. Designed with an open face storage system, easily keep your kitchen essentials in sight and access them quickly when you need them or even transport them from one side of the kitchen to the other utilizing the 4 base built in lockable wheels. Fitted with several storage options, the Merax Portable Island Kitchen cart has been designed with convenience in mind to help users easily store and tuck away essentials that would otherwise crowd their space: 2-Tier Paneled Shelving2-Tier shelving offers a space for larger items; dishes such as plates and bowls, cereal boxes, toasters and more3 Chrome Wire Sliding Baskets Gridded wire baskets are the perfect breathable storage option for fruit, vegetables and other fresh produce. Keep produce that you want to use in sight so you don’t forget about it in the refrigerator to rot. The 3 baskets are designed to slide in and out, while also being able to be completely removed if needed.1 Large Wooden Wine RackStore up to 3 wine-sized bottles in the built in top wine-rack.2 Storage DrawersOrganize various cutlery or utensils in the 2 top storage drawers or any small kitchen accessories you would like to keep out of view. Solid Oak Wood Top The spacious solid oak wood top can be used to display large kitchen essentials that might leave kitchen counters a bit crowded, such as paper towel rolls, a microwave or coffee maker. Utilize the Merax kitchen cart surface and be amazed at how much extra space you have on your kitchen countertops for preparing meals! Side Towel RackPlace a towel on the built-in side towel rack and conveniently out of the way to leave your oven handles free .DIMENSIONS & WEIGHT CAPACITIES* Overall Cart: 26.3\"L x 14.6\"W x 32.9\"H* Oak Wood Top Surface: 26.3\"L x 14.6\"W * Storage Drawer Interior: 11.8\"L x 10.5\"W x 2.5\"D* Wine rack: 14.6\"L x 11.4\"W * Paneled shelving: 14.6\"L x 11.4\"W * Wire Basket: 11.5\"L x 9.75\"W x 2.5\"D* Paneled shelving weight capacity: 8.8 lbs* Metal basket weight capacity: 8.8 lbs* Assembly is required.Notes:* Manual measurement has been used, there may be some reasonable error.* Items may slightly differ from photo in terms of color due to the lighting during photo shooting or your monitor's display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O2ZAaqEAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merax","source_asin":"B075F1HQ5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075F1HQ5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075F1HQ5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
