window.products.push({"id":1079446,"name":"Immerrity 2 Pcs Foldable Fly Fan For Outdoor Tables Fly Away Bug Repellent Fan Table Top Bug Repellent Fan with Holographic Blades for Outside or Insi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712+yu7H0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Foldable and Portable Table Fly Fan】:The repellent fly fan can be folded, if you need to take it outside after installation, you can lower the fly repellent fan and retract which is portable and easy to use. It is low power consumption and battery-powered by 2 AA batteries (the batteries are not included in the package). This bug fly fan is lightweight, effortlessly, and durable so you can carry it anywhere. 【Soft Blades Fan & Soft-stop Technology】:The repellent fly fan is made of high-quality abs material. Special light bending holographic pattern on the soft blades and its constant movement creates a disorienting environment that drives away bees, wasps, or flies. These soft-touch, high-quality fly fan blades are flexible but not flimsy. Designed to immediately stop when they contact an object so can be used by anyone, including children. 【Wider Range & No Noise】: The soft blade length of the fly fan for the outdoor table is longer than other products and has a broader range of action. A constant blade speed keeps insects well out of range of the fly fan. Keep your food and drink fresh on tables to relax and enjoy outdoor meals. Constantly working yet doesn't make any noise. No noise allows spending more time conversing with your family and friends and enjoy the outdoors in peace and quiet. 【Have Hook & Widely Used 】: The repellent fly fan has hooks at the bottom to hang the product upside down which is convenient. This portable fly fan has a very wide range of use. It is perfect for BBQs, indoor and outdoor parties, grilling, and picnics. You can finally enjoy a conversation over an outdoor meal without swatting flies all the time. There will be no other things landing on you or hovering over your food. 【Unique Design & Chemical-free】This bug-repellent fly fan has an exquisite tower appearance designed exclusively by us.This picnic-repellent fly fan is an eco-friendly,chemical-free non-toxic, and user-friendly solution. With the fly fan, you can avoid using stinky sprays, nasty flypaper, and useless candles.No more annoying and dangerous flies. Protect your health and your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712+yu7H0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Immerrity","source_asin":"B0C73YBPX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C73YBPX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C73YBPX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
