window.products.push({"id":1079457,"name":"Rare Lot!! Deep Purple Ex Quality Uruguay Amethyst with Calcite Symbiont Upright Standing Stone, Crystal Cluster Geode Druzy Specimen (Ex, 1-2 Lb)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K7FG6q2lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JIC Gem is proud to present to you our Amethyst with Calcite Symbiont upright standing series. You will be receiving one, Purple Amethyst with white Calcite Symbiont Crystal Cluster Geode Specimen which can stand by itself. Amethyst is a violet variety of quartz and the name comes from the Ancient Greek word amethustos, a reference to the belief that the stone protected its owner from drunkenness. The ancient Greeks and Romans wore amethyst and made drinking vessels of it in the belief that it would prevent intoxication, while medieval European soldiers wore amethyst amulets as protection in battle in the belief that amethysts heal people and keep them cool-headed. It is one of several forms of quartz. Amethyst is a semiprecious stone and is the traditional birthstone for February. Amethyst occurs in primary hues from a light pinkish violet to a deep purple. Amethyst may exhibit one or both secondary hues, red and blue. The best varieties of Amethysts can be found in Siberia, Sri Lanka, Brazil and the far East. The amethyst color can naturally result from displacement of transition elements even if the iron concentration is low. Chakra: Seventh Chakra - Crown or Pineal Gland. Associated Planet: Saturn. Zodiac: Pisces (also Aquarius, Aries, Capricorn). Birthstone: February. Amethyst with Calcite Symbiont is not as common as Amethyst it's self. It's around 10-15% Amethyst come with Calcite, make Miners not easy to find a good Calcite. JIC Gem select our products carefully. You will like it once it on your side!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K7FG6q2lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIC Gem","source_asin":"B00SO09D3I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SO09D3I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SO09D3I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
