window.products.push({"id":1079500,"name":"YuanKanJu Fun Emoji Shot Glasses Describing Your Group of Friends - Set of 6 - Funny Imprinted Messages","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WiQx8FqIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Make your drink nights ones to remember Do you want to make your drinking nights with your friends ones to remember? Excellent. These shot glasses with funny messages are perfect for that. In any group, there are people of different characters and these shot glasses captures these personalities perfectly. The shot glass set contains 6 glasses. Each glass has an emoji printed on it and a fun message that represent different characters for different people. The name on the box is ‘My Friends and I’ which goes on to bring out this diversity, Here are the writings on the glasses: Mr/Ms. Hothead: Seriously, this is my happy face (one who is always angry) Mr/Ms. Hothead: Seriously, this is my happy face (one who is always angry) Mr/Ms. money hungry: What’s the use of happiness? It can’t buy you money (the one who loves money) Mr/Ms. money hungry: What’s the use of happiness? It can’t buy you money (the one who loves money) Mr/Ms. Whiner: There are people who would love to have your bad days (the one who is always complaining) Mr/Ms. Whiner: There are people who would love to have your bad days (the one who is always complaining) Mr/Ms. sleepy head: waking up before 10AM should be illegal (the one who loves to sleep) Mr/Ms. sleepy head: waking up before 10AM should be illegal (the one who loves to sleep) Mr/Ms. lovey dovey: It wasn’t love at first sight. It took a full five minutes (the one who is always in love) Mr/Ms. lovey dovey: It wasn’t love at first sight. It took a full five minutes (the one who is always in love) Mr/Ms. sunglasses: Another year another pair (the one who is always wearing sunglasses) Mr/Ms. sunglasses: Another year another pair (the one who is always wearing sunglasses) They therefore make the perfect shot glass gift set that all your friends will absolutely love. These funny shot glasses will sure make your time much more enjoyable. No more boring times with your buddies. So, why not click ‘Add to Cart’ now? You friends will thank you for that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WiQx8FqIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WesiBox","source_asin":"B01N42JFII","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N42JFII","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N42JFII","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1079501,"name":"Natural Beautiful Polished Pink Agate Coaster Set from Brazil 3.5-4 inches Wide, with Rubber feet 4pc Gift Set, Certificate of Authenticity & Bonus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WslEQOTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Beautiful Polished Pink Agate Coaster set from Brazil 3.5-4 inches wide with rubber feet 4pc gift set. Excellent gift for any occasion, man or woman. Also Makes a Great Display Piece Unique Decorative Item. Agate is a banded form of finely-grained, microcrystalline Quartz. The lovely color patterns and banding make this translucent gemstone very unique. Agates can have many distinctive styles and patterns, but each Agate is unique in its own habit, with no two Agates being the same. Agates used as gemstones may be naturally colored, but they are often dyed. This is especially true of the Agates from Brazil that have more intense colors. Hot pink, blue, or green colors in Agate are always dyed. Make sure to Receive Beverly Oak's Exclusive Certificate of Authenticity and Bonus Lucky Gold Pirate Coin with every order!! Please note that due to the intense light used to take pictures some Coasters may look brighter in color than they actually are. Includes Exclusive Beverly Oaks Certificate of Authenticity. YOU WILL RECEIVE A SIMALR SET OF AGATE COASTERS NOT THE ONES IN THE PICTURE, EACH AGATE IS UNIQUE, WITH NO TWO AGATES BEING THE SAME.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WslEQOTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beverly Oaks","source_asin":"B01H7VJYYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H7VJYYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H7VJYYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
