window.products.push({"id":1079746,"name":"Spoontiques Thirst Aid Travel Mug, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WAz90VcsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Ceramic Travel Mug is perfect for anyone on the go! With a locking lid and a skid plated bottom this mug is the perfect travel companion. The double wall insulation keeps drinks hot or cold and it is both microwave and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WAz90VcsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spoontiques","source_asin":"B00V03YST0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00V03YST0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00V03YST0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1079747,"name":"Electric Can Opener, 2AA Batteries Operated, One Touch Can Opener, Smooth Edge Electric Can Opener, Chef's Best Choice(Black&Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O0MVT-tDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This product uses ABS and high-strength, durable, high-quality stainless-steel blades. With a simple press, it automatically spins and cuts open the Can – you do not even need to hold the Can. Operating the Can Opener Step 1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the Can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel.Step 2 – Place the Can on a flat surface and press the button for approximately one second and release it; then, the Can Opener will begin cutting the side of the Can.Step3 - When the cut is complete, immediately press the button to reverse the Cutter.Step4 - Ensure the Cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the Can Ppener off the Can. Troubleshooting 1. If the batteries are depleted, the Can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting operation. Remember to replace the batteries.2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven edges may stall the Can Opener. In this case, follow the above procedure to release the Can.3. If the Can gets stuck, press the white button on top of the Can Opener. Note: 1. Use two new batteries (High-quality AA batteries); cheaper lower-quality new batteries are inadequate and may not perform as required.2. After turning the Can completely upside down and cutting off the edge; the Can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid, will it be apparent that the Can and its resealable lid are detached?3. Do not lift or forcibly remove the can opener from the Can while it is operational. Forceful removal may damage the cutting-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O0MVT-tDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Can Opener","source_asin":"B08HHCBZ72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HHCBZ72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HHCBZ72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
