window.products.push({"id":1079901,"name":"Prepworks by Progressive Adjustable Slicer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JKGkN5vFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get perfect, even slices with the easy-to-use Adjustable Slicer from Progressive International--perfect for carrots, onions, zucchini, tomatoes, kiwi and apples. The wider slicing surface accommodates larger fruits and vegetables, and the angled blade provides more efficient slicing. You get three thickness options--thin, medium, and thick. Simply set the blade to the desired thickness with the slicing knob, then either hold the slicer at an angle to your cutting board or rest it over a bowl. A non-skid base keep the mandoline slicer stable on a flat cutting board, and it features ridges integrated into its sides to hold it securely against a bowl's rim. Secure your food with the included finger guard to slide it over the blade to get perfectly sized slices. Slide button down to lock for safe cleaning and storage. Dishwasher safe, but hand wash for best results. Get perfect, even slices. Three thickness settings. Ridges hug bowl rim. About Progressive International After 38 years in business, Progressive International is still dedicated to creating functional gadgets, tools, food-prep items and household products to make your cooking and meal preparation more efficient and fun. Located in Kent, Washington, Progressive's products are sold in the United States, Canada, Europe, South America, and other international markets. Progressive Makes Cooking Cool More than a workspace, the contemporary kitchen is the heart of the home where we connect with family and friends, and Progressive's philosophy of product design aims to create the perfect balance of form, function and value for your kitchen. The design process pulls from many different research methods such as ethnographic research, consumer testing, surveys, and in-home observations, identifying real life problems in the kitchen that translate to fresh, new ideas for smarter products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JKGkN5vFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B00440D0LI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00440D0LI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00440D0LI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1079902,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, 3.5L Cool Mist Ultrasonic Air Vaporizer for Baby Room Plants, Customized Humidity, Auto Mode & Ultra-Quiet Sleep M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617VvtWwRPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL DAY MIST - The 3.5L water tank is designed for rooms up to 300 sq ft & lasts up to 60 hours of operation between refills. Keebar air humidifier diffuses a maximum output of 300 ml/hr cool mist with 360° rotating nozzle which ensures the even level of humidity in your room, safely moisturizes the dry air in your room to relieves stress and create a comfortable and breathable living atmosphere at home. TOUCH PANEL & REMOTE ACCESS - The smart humidification system incorporates three types of humidity control: auto mode, constant humidity & 5 speed levels with a 24hour timer program. Equipped with user-friendly touch panel and remote control highlight the this air humidifier to 40-95% RH humidity level. Just stay in the bed or crouch on the sofa, then you can set the device as you wish via the handy remote. What a nice humidifier for baby, adult and even plants humidifier! WHISPER QUIET & SPEEL MODE - This powerful air humidifier produces a near silent frequency (<40dB) to ensure the ultra quiet operation for a full night sleep by deactivating all lights and sounds when sleep mode is on. You can keep your humidifier working throughout the night without disturbance, Sleep mode making it perfect by creating a disturbance-free enviornment for babies, kids, seniors and sensitive sleepers. INTELLIGENT CONSTANT HUMIDITY - The air humidifier is sensitive to humidity changes, 24-hour timer programs this cool mist humidifier automatically stops or restarts working to maintain a set 40%-60% comfort level in which can save energy and prevent unit damage. Better air means a better life! EASILY REFILL AND CLEAN - And you’ll never have trouble cleaning the inside of the humidifier, just Simply open the top cover to add clean water directly to the water tank through the wide opening top. Never bother to disassemble the device to fill it with water.Keebar humidifier will automatically shut off when water runs out to protect itself from damage and keep you safe. The product will come with one-year warranty, feel free to contact us if you have any enquiries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617VvtWwRPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keebar","source_asin":"B07YJRXVCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YJRXVCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YJRXVCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
