window.products.push({"id":1079992,"name":"10 Sets LED Light up BoBo Balloons, 20 Inch Pre-Stretched Transparent Balloons with 10 Ft LED String Lights, 12 Clear Bobo Balloons and 3 Levels Flash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OSnOyxlcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package includes: you will get 10 sets of LED light up balloons, and we will add 1 more LED light box and 2 more balloons to prevent you from bursting the first time inflating, that's to say you will get 11 pieces LED light boxes (each about 10 feet long without batteries) and 12 pieces transparent balloons Size information: before inflated, these transparent balloons are about 20 cm/ 7.87 inches, the maximum size of the balloon is 20 inches, recommended size is 10 to 15 inches to avoid overstretching and bursting; You'd better to use an electric inflating pump and after inflating, tie a knot in the balloon bundle, then tie the rope Pre-stretched balloons: ordinary bobo balloons may need to be stretched before inflating to achieve a better effect, but we use a machine to stretch each balloon in advance, thus you can directly inflate the balloon with no need of stretching them again, inflated balloon will be round and pretty Well made: these transparent bobo balloons are made of durable TPU material, waterproof and safe to use, not easy to tear and break, due to the clear appearance, you can display beautiful light emitted from the string lights, use them to prepare your party and get a stunning decorative effect, bring your guests unforgettable time Suitable for: these LED light up bobo balloons are suitable for various occasions and scenes, such as Valentine's Day, weddings, Christmas, birthday, proposal, party, New Year, Halloween and so on, LED light can not only bring brightness to surroundings, but also create a warm and dreamy atmosphere, or just use them as photo props to taking meaningful pictures with your friends and family","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OSnOyxlcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sumind","source_asin":"B09B9NDTVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1079992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B9NDTVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B9NDTVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
